fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Hillcrest</text>\n<text x=\"509.6\" y=\"271.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Lakeside</text>\n<text x=\"357.6\" y=\"241.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Opera</text>\n<text x=\"312.0\" y=\"226.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Museum</text>\n<text x=\"190.4\" y=\"286.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Mill Lane</text>\n<text x=\"257.3\" y=\"469.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Docks</text>\n<text x=\"372.8\" y=\"286.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Market</text>\n<text x=\"448.8\" y=\"150.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Garden</text>\n<text x=\"312.0\" y=\"89.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Northpark</text>\n<text x=\"509.6\" y=\"362.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Business Park</text>\n</svg>\n<div id=\"ec-tooltip-1\" style=\"\n  display:none;position:absolute;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;\n  font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;pointer-events:none;\n  background:var(--ect-57425a7e);color:var(--ect-21ade003);\n  box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);max-width:min(260px,100%);box-sizing:border-box;\n  z-index:999;line-height:1.4;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\n\"></div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var tip=document.currentScript.parentElement.querySelector('#ec-tooltip-1');\n  var svg=document.currentScript.parentElement.querySelector('svg');\n  if(!svg||!tip) return;\n  // Next to the pointer but inside the plot (flipped to the pointer's left near the right edge),\n  // since anything past its edges is clipped, and scrolls, in a notebook or Quarto cell\n  function place(ev){\n    var r=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var x=ev.clientX-r.left+12,y=ev.clientY-r.top-10;\n    if(x+tip.offsetWidth>r.width) x=ev.clientX-r.left-12-tip.offsetWidth;\n    tip.style.left=Math.max(0,Math.min(x,r.width-tip.offsetWidth))+'px';\n    tip.style.top=Math.max(0,Math.min(y,r.height-tip.offsetHeight))+'px';\n  }\n  function show(el,ev){\n    var raw=el.getAttribute('data-attrs');\n    if(!raw) return;\n    try{var d=JSON.parse(raw)}catch(e){return}\n    var h='';\n    for(var k in d){\n      var v=d[k];\n      if(Array.isArray(v)) v=v.join(', ');\n      h+='<div><b>'+k+'</b>: '+v+'</div>';\n    }\n    if(!h) return;\n    tip.innerHTML=h;tip.style.display='block';\n    place(ev);\n  }\n  svg.addEventListener('mouseover',function(ev){\n    var t=ev.target;\n    if(t.hasAttribute('data-node')||t.hasAttribute('data-edge')) show(t,ev);\n  });\n  svg.addEventListener('mousemove',function(ev){\n    if(tip.style.display==='block') place(ev);\n  });\n  svg.addEventListener('mouseout',function(ev){\n    var t=ev.target;\n    if(t.hasAttribute('data-node')||t.hasAttribute('data-edge'))\n      tip.style.display='none';\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</div></div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\nFor large graphs, `greedy=True` builds the group one node at a time.\n\n## Notes {.doc-notes}\n\nNetworkX's `prominent_group()` subtracts the paths with an endpoint in the group only\nafter the search, which picks the wrong group on disconnected and directed graphs, where\nthat count depends on the group. It also halves the path counts on weighted graphs and\nnever completes a group from exactly the remaining candidates. EdgeCase's search avoids\nall three and agrees with an exhaustive search over every group; NetworkX also rounds the\nscore to two decimals.\n\n",
